    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;In Doctor Dreams, you own a clinic, sell medicine, and can treat special patients by entering their dreams&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/cf19585a7ec53d0a25dd7a088e66f136.avif?t=1755782649\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/1e165657ba31e684681edfb301d520a2.poster.avif?t=1755782649\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/1e165657ba31e684681edfb301d520a2.webm?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/1e165657ba31e684681edfb301d520a2.mp4?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create personalized medicine to deliver to your customers or patients. Combine unique ingredients, follow secret recipes, and experiment to discover new effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/69d4f2a33f182597f60523675eb61009.avif?t=1755782649\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/714732c085a70df64a2e178c3efe2fa2.poster.avif?t=1755782649\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/714732c085a70df64a2e178c3efe2fa2.webm?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/714732c085a70df64a2e178c3efe2fa2.mp4?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan prices, take orders, deliver them correctly, receive payment, and give change if needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/9118b0ad58572b4c3084fe2f793f1918.avif?t=1755782649\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/bf6a6228ea121bdfee4e9090fda4ac80.poster.avif?t=1755782649\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/bf6a6228ea121bdfee4e9090fda4ac80.webm?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/bf6a6228ea121bdfee4e9090fda4ac80.mp4?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive patients, clean rooms, hire staff, upgrade facilities, and earn reputation\u2026 or end up bankrupt due to malpractice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/359fbff5e109fe54ddc1203a0eedd1c2.avif?t=1755782649\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2120bd45b018c1b19cd84a8a9c73cd1f.poster.avif?t=1755782649\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2120bd45b018c1b19cd84a8a9c73cd1f.webm?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2120bd45b018c1b19cd84a8a9c73cd1f.mp4?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day sales not enough?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the decision to sell your illegal medicine at night on the black market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful: the police are watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/8f93131eaf82285e8c42f28cd883f7e1.avif?t=1755782649\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2d1096077f49bfca16196153562334a6.poster.avif?t=1755782649\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2d1096077f49bfca16196153562334a6.webm?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2d1096077f49bfca16196153562334a6.mp4?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique dreams divided into 5 chapters, each with completely different mechanics: from boss fights and puzzle solving to stealth sequences and psychological horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/196018a2e4722fc1d4a22f08c8ee6f98.avif?t=1755782649\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/26682862c42f5a844a0a3d25184e5142.poster.avif?t=1755782649\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/26682862c42f5a844a0a3d25184e5142.webm?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/26682862c42f5a844a0a3d25184e5142.mp4?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rival clinic hides something on the third floor. If you decide to infiltrate it, you must move stealthily, avoid cameras, and outsmart an advanced AI that learns your movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/fb30ed8a9119f8ff9c16ac38cbd8b4fd.avif?t=1755782649\" width=610 height=230 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;In Doctor Dreams, you own a clinic, sell medicine, and can treat special patients by entering their dreams&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/cf19585a7ec53d0a25dd7a088e66f136.avif?t=1755782649\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/1e165657ba31e684681edfb301d520a2.poster.avif?t=1755782649\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/1e165657ba31e684681edfb301d520a2.webm?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/1e165657ba31e684681edfb301d520a2.mp4?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create personalized medicine to deliver to your customers or patients. Combine unique ingredients, follow secret recipes, and experiment to discover new effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/69d4f2a33f182597f60523675eb61009.avif?t=1755782649\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/714732c085a70df64a2e178c3efe2fa2.poster.avif?t=1755782649\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/714732c085a70df64a2e178c3efe2fa2.webm?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/714732c085a70df64a2e178c3efe2fa2.mp4?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan prices, take orders, deliver them correctly, receive payment, and give change if needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/9118b0ad58572b4c3084fe2f793f1918.avif?t=1755782649\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/bf6a6228ea121bdfee4e9090fda4ac80.poster.avif?t=1755782649\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/bf6a6228ea121bdfee4e9090fda4ac80.webm?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/bf6a6228ea121bdfee4e9090fda4ac80.mp4?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive patients, clean rooms, hire staff, upgrade facilities, and earn reputation\u2026 or end up bankrupt due to malpractice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/359fbff5e109fe54ddc1203a0eedd1c2.avif?t=1755782649\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2120bd45b018c1b19cd84a8a9c73cd1f.poster.avif?t=1755782649\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2120bd45b018c1b19cd84a8a9c73cd1f.webm?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2120bd45b018c1b19cd84a8a9c73cd1f.mp4?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day sales not enough?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the decision to sell your illegal medicine at night on the black market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful: the police are watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/8f93131eaf82285e8c42f28cd883f7e1.avif?t=1755782649\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2d1096077f49bfca16196153562334a6.poster.avif?t=1755782649\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2d1096077f49bfca16196153562334a6.webm?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2d1096077f49bfca16196153562334a6.mp4?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique dreams divided into 5 chapters, each with completely different mechanics: from boss fights and puzzle solving to stealth sequences and psychological horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/196018a2e4722fc1d4a22f08c8ee6f98.avif?t=1755782649\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/26682862c42f5a844a0a3d25184e5142.poster.avif?t=1755782649\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/26682862c42f5a844a0a3d25184e5142.webm?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/26682862c42f5a844a0a3d25184e5142.mp4?t=1755782649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rival clinic hides something on the third floor. If you decide to infiltrate it, you must move stealthily, avoid cameras, and outsmart an advanced AI that learns your movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/fb30ed8a9119f8ff9c16ac38cbd8b4fd.avif?t=1755782649\" width=610 height=230 /></span></p>",
